sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant FE as React
  participant API as Node API
  U->>FE: email + password
  FE->>API: POST /auth/login
  API->>API: bcrypt.compare
  API-->>FE: { token, user }
  FE->>FE: store token
  FE->>API: GET /me (Bearer token)
  API->>API: verifyJWT
  API-->>FE: user profile
